{{Term/Store|Tingle's Outfit||Series, BotW}} is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="BotW Adventure Log"/>{{Name Ref|TotK}}

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Tingle's Outfit is exclusive to {{TMT}} [[Downloadable Content]] pack. It can be found by using [[Magnesis]] to pull three [[Hidden Chest]]s from the ground in various spots in [[Hyrule Field]]. [[Tingle's Hood]] is located in the [[Exchange Ruins]], [[Tingle's Shirt]] is located in the [[Castle Town Prison]] on [[Hyrule Castle West]], and [[Tingle's Tights]] can be found in the [[Mabe Village Ruins]]. Like the [[Dark Series]], [[Phantom Ganon Set]], [[Phantom Equipment]], and [[Radiant Set]], wearing it results in other characters being scared of Link.

